sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Envoy Proxy
    participant EPP as EPP gRPC Server<br/>9002/TCP<br/>Optional TLS
    participant Plugins as Plugin Pipeline<br/>(Scheduling, Flow Control,<br/>Data Layer, Parsing)
    participant DS as In-Memory Datastore
    participant Backend as Model-Serving Pod
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP TLS 1.2+
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>9090/TCP HTTP
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry Collector<br/>OTLP/gRPC

    Note over EPP,K8sAPI: Controller Reconciliation (startup + continuous)
    EPP->>K8sAPI: Watch InferencePool, InferenceModelRewrite,<br/>InferenceObjective, Pod resources<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>EPP: Resource events (create/update/delete)
    EPP->>DS: Populate endpoint state,<br/>model rewrites, objectives

    Note over Client,Backend: Inference Request Flow
    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/completions<br/>HTTPS
    Envoy->>EPP: gRPC ExtProc callout<br/>Port 9002<br/>Optional TLS
    EPP->>Plugins: Evaluate request
    Plugins->>DS: Query available endpoints,<br/>model configs, objectives
    DS-->>Plugins: Endpoint state + configs
    Plugins-->>EPP: Selected backend pod +<br/>optional request rewrite
    EPP-->>Envoy: Routing decision<br/>(target pod + headers)
    Envoy->>Backend: Forward request to<br/>selected pod
    Backend-->>Envoy: Inference response
    Envoy-->>Client: Response

    Note over EPP,OTel: Observability
    EPP->>Prom: Expose /metrics<br/>Port 9090 HTTP
    EPP-->>OTel: Export traces<br/>OTLP/gRPC (runtime configured)
